; claude: mail as bytes (plan_tiny_eudora.md): Mail (a message, RFC
; 822), Mime (its parts and encodings, RFCs 2045-2047), Mbox (a mailbox
; file), Mail_thread (conversations, Zawinski's threading). Formats,
; not protocols -- a mailbox is read with no network at all -- so a
; folder of their own beside protocols/, which has the two that carry
; them, Smtp and Pop3. Pure OCaml, no sockets.
(library
 (name networking_mail)
 (package elm_playground)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries
   elm_core ; Base64 (MIME's), Civil and Clock (the dates)
 )
)
